Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.51,0:11:01.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姚玲 王玲 欢迎来到…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh Yao Ling Wa Ling,{\r}
