Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.98,0:11:05.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello. - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.32,0:11:08.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们发明了信息连接 象在线交易系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They created lnfolink sort of an online trading system{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.65,0:11:10.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用于国际间的情报交换\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for swapping international secrets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.79,0:11:15.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.46,0:11:17.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.10,0:11:18.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.46,0:11:19.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,香槟酒？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Champagne?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.40,0:11:20.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不喝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't have any of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.53,0:11:22.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.20,0:11:27.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉有点不对头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something doesn't feel right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.27,0:11:28.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毫不奇怪 你的伙伴在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No wonder your buddy's here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.04,0:11:30.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的伙伴 有奇怪的笑声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your buddy with the weird laugh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.81,0:11:32.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的笑声不奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He does not have a weird laugh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.08,0:11:35.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们正在… 谈论你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were just... talking about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.45,0:11:36.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.75,0:11:40.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看来很棒 卡门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow. You look great Carmen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.79,0:11:43.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 想跳舞吗？- 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You want to dance? - Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.22,0:11:45.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不认为那是个好主意 加利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think that's a good idea Gary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.66,0:11:48.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家规规定 你要征得我父亲的同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Family rules say you need to ask my father's permission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.43,0:11:51.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的衣服应该剪掉 朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know you should have had that suit tailored Juni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.23,0:11:52.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它都挤到你的肚子上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's bunching up around your gut,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.97,0:11:54.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那使你的脑袋看起来太大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it makes your head look way too big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.77,0:11:57.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你原谅我弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to excuse my little brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.67,0:12:00.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还在为… 魔术器的事生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's still a little upset about the...Juggler incident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.97,0:12:02.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个好特工 应该会控制情绪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A good agent controls his temper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.01,0:12:07.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的 我爸爸不在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just be glad my dad isn't here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.65,0:12:09.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他对这种事确实有些神经\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gets really psycho about this sort of thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.08,0:12:12.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.89,0:12:14.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你记得加利吗 他在我们组织里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um you remember Gary. He's in our organization.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.99,0:12:17.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在邀请你的女儿跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just asking your daughter for a dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.42,0:12:18.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会跳舞吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know how to dance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.02,0:12:20.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳得很好 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fairly well sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.13,0:12:21.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么舞？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of dances?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.29,0:12:22.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各种舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All types of dances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.59,0:12:23.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 探戈怎样？- 可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What about tango? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.00,0:12:25.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 曼波？- 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mambo? - Fairly well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:26.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 伦巴？- 可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rumba? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.43,0:12:27.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 恰恰恰？- 7步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cha-cha-cha? - Seven steps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.60,0:12:28.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 波萨诺沃？- 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bossa nova? - Mm-hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.67,0:12:29.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 梅伦格？- 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Merengue? - Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.17,0:12:36.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,华尔兹怎样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about waltz?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.51,0:12:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 我会华尔兹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Y-Yeah I can waltz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.54,0:12:40.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.32,0:12:45.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.29,0:12:53.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就象那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.06,0:12:57.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.53,0:12:59.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们可以跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can go to dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.04,0:13:06.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看着你姐姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch your older sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.99,0:13:28.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚历山德拉？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alexandra?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.06,0:13:29.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.06,0:13:31.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在那里干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.76,0:13:33.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dancing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.53,0:13:36.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你总是带着这些特工吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you always carry this many Secret Service around?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.47,0:13:38.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸爸的主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dad's idea{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.34,0:13:41.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有点… 妄想症\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's gotten a little...paranoid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.87,0:13:46.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那 你能和我… 跳舞吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well would you dance... with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.38,0:13:47.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.95,0:13:51.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那好 等一会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right,hold on a second guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.18,0:13:52.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,2级人物 散开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Level 2 break it up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.69,0:13:57.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为何不？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.02,0:14:01.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只跳…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only dance...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.53,0:14:02.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芭蕾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ballet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.23,0:14:08.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 不可思议的巧合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What an incredible coincidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.10,0:14:11.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So do l.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.30,0:14:42.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱尼 我必须承认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well Juni I must say,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.93,0:14:45.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是个有才华的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're a man of many talents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.38,0:14:51.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冰山一角\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One tries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.75,0:14:58.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 请入座好吗？我们要开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh could you find your seats? We're ready to start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.25,0:15:03.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必须走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.29,0:15:10.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女士们先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.63,0:15:12.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎美国总统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the president of the United States.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.37,0:15:18.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.44,0:15:22.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我为 欧斯 自豪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am proud of the O.S.S.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.71,0:15:24.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有他们新建的特工小子分队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and their newly formed Spy Kids division.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.98,0:15:27.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们昨天的成就\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For their outstanding accomplishments yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.81,0:15:29.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加利 和 杰蒂 吉格斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gary and Gerti Giggles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.05,0:15:31.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不仅救了我的女儿…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not only saved my daughter...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.62,0:15:34.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在说什么？我救了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is he talking about?! I saved her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.35,0:15:35.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱尼…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Juni...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.65,0:15:39.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但更重要的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But more importantly,if not most importantly,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.19,0:15:42.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们安全地找回了魔酷光碟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they safely retrieved the Transmooker device{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.53,0:15:45.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我女儿在我办公室 在那前一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that my daughter accidentally took from my office{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.16,0:15:46.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偶然拿走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}earlier that day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.50,0:15:49.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 我荣幸地宣布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now it is my great pleasure to announce{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.84,0:15:52.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欧斯新的长官…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the new director of the O.S.S....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.17,0:15:55.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格瑞利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gregor-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.54,0:16:01.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,… 唐纳根·吉格斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Donnagon Giggles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.89,0:16:12.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加利 和 杰蒂 吉格斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gary and Gerti Giggles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.56,0:16:14.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我们所需要特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are the kind of agents we need{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.09,0:16:16.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给欧斯注入生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to turn the O.S.S. around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.70,0:16:18.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我荣幸地授与他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am proud to award them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.06,0:16:22.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1级人物徽章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}these Level 1 badges,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.90,0:16:27.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 这使他们可执行真正的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - which will enable them to take on real missions,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.17,0:16:30.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,具有挑战性的 象尤卡达任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}something challenging,like the Ukata assignment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.08,0:16:31.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.58,0:16:34.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要那个任务 这不公平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted that assignment. This is so unfair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.95,0:16:37.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我荣幸地宣布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am proud to claim them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.35,0:16:40.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是我们组织中的 高级特工小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as our organization's top Spy Kid operatives!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.72,0:16:41.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事情有点不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's not right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.05,0:16:43.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并且我荣幸地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm also proud{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.42,0:16:46.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宣布 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to claim them of course,{\r}
