Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.23,0:24:41.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若他们还没有把它清理掉 就会在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they haven't cleaned it out yet.{\r}
