Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.47,0:25:54.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,述说了幻觉似的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tell delusional tales{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.17,0:25:57.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个奇怪生物居住的神秘的岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of a mysterious island populated by strange creatures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.44,0:26:01.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,显然 那里附近没有陆地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obviously no land mass is located anywhere near there,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.08,0:26:04.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 这故事没人相信 特工也被开除了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so these tales were dismissed and the agents fired.{\r}
