Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.54,0:26:27.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们肯定接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bet we accept.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.54,0:26:30.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回来 小绿瓢 干得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come home R.A.L.P.H. Good work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.88,0:26:33.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是个了不起的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a great assignment,{\r}
