Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.80,0:30:50.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只当是安乐死吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so think of it as a mercy killing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.31,0:30:55.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加利和杰蒂 吉格斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gary and Gerti Giggles,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.84,0:30:58.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的任务是SElKJu9\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you have assignment SElKJu9.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.68,0:31:00.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.28,0:31:04.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让那过时的玩意伤了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't hurt yourselves with that outdated gear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.12,0:31:07.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记住 一个特工和他的装备一样好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember an agent is only as good as his gadgets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.05,0:31:10.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.29,0:31:12.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是尤卡达任务？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have the Ukata assignment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.46,0:31:14.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.76,0:31:16.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会喜欢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll love it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.40,0:31:22.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 菲利克斯叔叔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks Uncle Felix.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.63,0:31:26.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是你的叔叔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not your uncle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.21,0:31:35.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 好潜艇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh nice sub.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.11,0:31:38.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎来到间谍龙 DLX\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the DragonSpy DLX.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.78,0:31:41.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来他们越来越复杂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seems like they get more and more sophisticated{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.32,0:31:42.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个月如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}each month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.69,0:31:44.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都是自动的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything is automated!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.82,0:31:46.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在为您剪鼻毛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now picking your nose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.99,0:31:52.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ugh little brothers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.34,0:32:02.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来看看有什么午餐 这可是完成任务的养料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's check our lunchboxes for mission updates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.59,0:32:19.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 小绿瓢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry R.A.L.P.H.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.49,0:32:22.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是最好的间谍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were the best spy on the force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.66,0:32:25.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱尼 别管它 他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Juni leave it alone. He's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.33,0:32:27.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全拜你那朋友加利所赐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks to your buddy Gary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.36,0:32:28.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是无意的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was an accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.73,0:32:30.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喜欢他且相信他？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You like him and believe him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.04,0:32:34.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不喜欢他… 不是很喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like him... that much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.18,0:32:44.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加利是个坏家伙 卡门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gary's a bad guy Carmen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.88,0:32:46.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.02,0:32:48.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我可以改变他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I can change him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.02,0:32:51.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不明白你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not understand you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.82,0:32:53.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你永远不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you never will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.82,0:32:55.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,法国炸鸡？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}French fry sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.76,0:32:59.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gimme that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.60,0:33:07.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪 神秘岛的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strange, tales of a mysterious island,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.84,0:33:10.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消失的船 神秘的物种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}disappearing ships,mysterious creatures,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.64,0:33:12.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并且 欧斯的货物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and yet,no information anywhere{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.91,0:33:14.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,磁性飞船 没有任何信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the O.S.S. cargo or the magnet ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.05,0:33:17.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唐纳根在那里干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's Donnagon doing there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.18,0:33:19.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他那时还不是 欧斯的长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wasn't O.S.S. director yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.38,0:33:21.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是原来 欧斯的秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are old O.S.S. secrets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.69,0:33:25.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道一个我们可以求助的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I know just the person we can call for advice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.02,0:33:28.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.63,0:33:30.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.93,0:33:32.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.00,0:33:35.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,何时？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.23,0:33:37.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.40,0:33:38.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁？ 什么 何时？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who? What? When?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.00,0:33:40.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哪里？ - 为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where? - And why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.37,0:33:41.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我乐于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I delight in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.64,0:33:44.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我要找的答案？ - 寻找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What... Do I intend to find? - Find{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.54,0:33:45.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一次？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.98,0:33:46.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到处跑 跳下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run around! Jumping down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.01,0:33:48.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳起来…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bounce and bound and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.35,0:33:49.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找另一个方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find another way to duck and hide{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.68,0:33:50.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个小岛…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isle of...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.68,0:33:52.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dreams{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.29,0:33:59.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.99,0:34:01.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.33,0:34:03.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One moment please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.30,0:34:06.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut!!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.60,0:34:14.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁 请再说一遍？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is it again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.54,0:34:18.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱尼 克兹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Juni Cortez!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.98,0:34:20.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能为你做点什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can I do for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.78,0:34:23.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说 你为我做了很多事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean,you've done so much for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.08,0:34:24.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的机器人复制品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your robot counterparts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.52,0:34:26.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,深深地打动了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are the surprise hit characters of my show!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.95,0:34:28.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问个好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.65,0:34:30.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello - Hello{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.86,0:34:34.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上 卡门想和迷你安先生谈一谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually Carmen wants a word with Mr. Minion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.79,0:34:37.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 他在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. He's right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.67,0:34:45.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迷你安正在研究4合1的协调问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Minion is practicing a 4-part harmony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.87,0:34:48.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有一分钟时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have one minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.94,0:34:54.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bueno?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.34,0:34:56.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你过得怎么样 迷你安？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you doing Minion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.08,0:34:58.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里的东西对我来说都提不起精神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things are a little Floopy around here for my taste,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.85,0:35:00.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但还算过得去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's a living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.95,0:35:03.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要一些情报是关于你感兴趣的的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need some information on your favorite subject{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.45,0:35:04.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欧斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}O.S.S. the O.S.S.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.79,0:35:06.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要打个电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to make a call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.12,0:35:08.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 你准备好了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay you ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.93,0:35:10.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤卡达…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ukata...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.36,0:35:12.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔酷光碟…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Transmooker...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.46,0:35:14.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很难搜索到总统的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The president's daughter is unavailable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.40,0:35:15.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.40,0:35:16.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按"1"开始记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Press "1" to record.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.70,0:35:18.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你指的是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mean anything to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.17,0:35:21.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像是为唐纳根-吉格斯工作的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smells like the work of Donnagon Giggles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.57,0:35:24.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是第一个接触到魔酷光碟技术的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had first contact with the Transmooker technology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.64,0:35:26.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为唐纳根这一切的幕后人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think Donnagon's the one behind all this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.88,0:35:28.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你正在和一个有四个头的人说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're talking to a man with four heads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.01,0:35:30.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信我 这家伙很坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me the guy is dirt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.65,0:35:32.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们该找谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What should we look for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.22,0:35:34.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先 找到这个岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First find the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.52,0:35:36.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后找到岛人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then find the lsland Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.99,0:35:38.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样就能和唐纳根联系上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would have been Donnagon's contact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.96,0:35:39.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.99,0:35:41.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢了 迷你安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks Minion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.26,0:35:43.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做个好姑娘 并帮我好好揍一顿你弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be a good girl and swat your brother for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.49,0:35:44.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 我会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.66,0:35:49.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出问题了 控制方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's wrong! Take the wheel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.40,0:35:51.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走了 好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got to go. Good luck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.40,0:35:53.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,减速 我们接近目的地了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slow down! We're nearing destination zone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.94,0:35:56.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有效航程设置正确…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The radius where all the disappearances occurred is right...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.57,0:35:58.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.68,0:36:04.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器停了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been shut down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.45,0:36:07.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold onto something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.36,0:36:22.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的动力都关闭了 连紧急电源也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All power is off even the emergency power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.47,0:36:25.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的手电筒也不亮了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My flashlight doesn't even work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.70,0:36:27.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们被困住了 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're stuck aren't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.37,0:36:31.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们先从这出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.74,0:36:35.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rebreathers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.18,0:36:36.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rebreathers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.98,0:36:38.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以手动控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to do it by hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.88,0:36:40.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What next?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.32,0:36:44.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 手 卡门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope. Hand Carmen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.19,0:36:50.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难以置信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unbelievable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.93,0:36:53.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,烂东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Low-tech!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.74,0:37:01.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.30,0:37:30.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该用轻的还是重的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should we travel light or heavy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.33,0:37:32.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也许不会回到这来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We may not be coming back down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.37,0:37:34.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还是用重的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go heavy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.77,0:37:36.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,充气服？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inflate-a-suits?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.91,0:37:39.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没有太多的选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have much choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.11,0:37:44.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少呼吸面具还能用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least the masks work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.95,0:37:49.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想是真空管的问题 不是电源的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's because they're valve-operated,not electrical-based.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.52,0:37:50.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太奇怪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's so strange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.02,0:37:52.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.99,0:37:54.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You too!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.52,0:37:56.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠近点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay close!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.18,0:38:17.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ugh! - Ugh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.51,0:38:20.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 噢 太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ugh. Oh great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.18,0:38:21.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我胖了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.65,0:38:23.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对于这个事故你怎么看？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was it supposed to do this?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.39,0:38:25.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实电路有自动关闭开关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has an electrical automatic shutoff{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.72,0:38:27.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是它出了问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which didn't work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.26,0:38:30.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好 壳体破裂之前我们及时出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luckily we ran out of air before the suits exploded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.56,0:38:33.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 我们可以笑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well we can still laugh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.46,0:38:35.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笑什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.30,0:38:38.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎样 想象一下加利和杰蒂在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At whatever you can imagine Gary and Gerti are doing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.04,0:38:40.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}right about now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.85,0:38:52.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰蒂 我们在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gerti where are we?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.18,0:38:53.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.65,0:38:55.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按照我显示的坐标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}according to my coordinates,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.72,0:38:57.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we are...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.42,0:38:58.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.30,0:39:09.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,骆驼粪坑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Camel poop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.97,0:39:13.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,某人要付出代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone's gonna pay!!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.87,0:39:16.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克兹姐弟…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cordezes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.24,0:39:22.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的新办公室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like your new office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.71,0:39:25.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太小了… 舒服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's smaller...cozy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.15,0:39:28.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特别… 小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Especially...smaller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.75,0:39:31.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.49,0:39:33.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么多成功的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So many successful missions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.22,0:39:34.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,令人惊奇 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amazing isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.93,0:39:36.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得这个吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember this one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.56,0:39:38.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 那是哪一个任务？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Which mission is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.80,0:39:40.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,墨西哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mexico.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.66,0:39:42.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.67,0:39:44.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.73,0:39:46.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上 那是我们唯一的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually,that was the one mission{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.64,0:39:48.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有完成的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we never accomplished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.34,0:39:49.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,英格丽…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ingrid...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.34,0:39:51.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再惊动你的父母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}don't start with your parents again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.01,0:39:54.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好笑你会提起他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's funny you should mention them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.18,0:39:57.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 每当我提起你的父母恰恰不好笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. When I mention your parents it is the exact opposite of funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.65,0:40:00.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们从未得到他们的祝福还困扰着你吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't it bother you that we never got their full blessing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.32,0:40:02.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 坦白地说 你应该另外找个机会给他们看 - 好的 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Frankly you deserve another chance to show them - All right all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.95,0:40:05.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你愿意的话可以邀请他们 但我不会在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Invite them if you want,but I won't be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.69,0:40:08.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉他们我... 我有其他任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell them that I had a I had to go on another mission,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.63,0:40:11.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说 我们在月球上有点小问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that that we're having a little problem on the moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.43,0:40:13.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我父亲喜欢月球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father loves the moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.97,0:40:23.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经邀请了他们 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You invited them already,didn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.17,0:40:24.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯… 定义一下"邀请"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mm...define "invite."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.84,0:40:25.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克兹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cortezes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.04,0:40:27.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.08,0:40:30.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有些坏消息 我可以进来吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have some bad news. May I come in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.15,0:40:31.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Uh. - Uh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.38,0:40:32.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 当然 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Certainly sir. - Yes sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.45,0:40:33.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.86,0:40:42.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.17,0:40:52.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们派出的两个特工小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two of our Spy Kid operatives{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.54,0:40:54.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在尤卡达任务时失去联络\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are lost on the Ukata assignment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.37,0:40:55.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的孩子就在进行这个任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your children had that assignment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.74,0:40:57.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 唐纳根 我们怎么补救？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry Donnagon. How can we help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.31,0:40:59.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上 我的孩子们都安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually,my children are safe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.61,0:41:02.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在戈壁沙漠的某个地方 我相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}somewhere in the Gobi Desert,I believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.75,0:41:04.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我很遗憾说到卡门和朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh I'm sorry to say that Carmen and Juni{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.02,0:41:07.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知为何 在尤卡达任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are somehow the ones on the Ukata assignment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.85,0:41:09.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,某些计算错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a computing error of some kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.52,0:41:11.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 通信？- 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Communications? - None.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.09,0:41:12.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their DragonSpy ship doesn't show up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.92,0:41:14.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷达和卫星都找不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on radar or satellite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.59,0:41:16.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格瑞利 英格丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Greg lngrid,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.09,0:41:18.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们曾经冒着生命危险救过我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you guys risked your lives once before to save me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.86,0:41:20.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我现在就去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me go now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.33,0:41:23.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要亲自去带你们的孩子回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and personally bring your children back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.90,0:41:25.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.20,0:41:26.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 唐纳根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you Donnagon,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.67,0:41:29.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 不好意思 我们必须自己去做这件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but respectfully,we have to do this ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.11,0:41:31.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你能为我们提供战术后援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you could provide tactical backup{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.34,0:41:33.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和监控支持的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and surveillance support of our efforts,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.44,0:41:34.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们马上就出发了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'll leave immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.74,0:41:35.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.22,0:41:46.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 英格丽…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh lngrid...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.62,0:41:49.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道不合时宜 但 嗯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know this may be a bad time but um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.59,0:41:52.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你父母来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your parents are here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.12,0:42:15.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你们告诉我你们要下星期二才来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you guys told me you were coming next Tuesday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.35,0:42:17.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一个非常危险的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a very dangerous assignment,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.49,0:42:18.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们必须在此等候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you have to wait here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.06,0:42:20.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那 我们需要帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well we want to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.32,0:42:22.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.06,0:42:25.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你教会了我知道的每一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You taught me everything I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.23,0:42:27.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.33,0:42:31.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是并不是每一件事我们都了如指掌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but not everything we know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.23,0:42:33.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 爸爸 几小时后再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course not Dad. See you in a few hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.30,0:42:35.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.25,0:42:49.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是不喜欢他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I still don't like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.19,0:42:54.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱尼… 朱尼…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Juni... Juni...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.29,0:42:56.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那岛原来就在那吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was that there before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.73,0:43:03.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一分钟前才有的 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That wasn't there a minute ago was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.37,0:43:06.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在踢我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kicking me?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.10,0:43:07.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我离你远着呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm way over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.47,0:43:11.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得有什么东西在碰我的脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I felt something against my foot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.61,0:43:14.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的下面有什么东西 快看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something under me! Come look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.61,0:43:17.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么都没看到 朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't see anything Juni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.51,0:43:20.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还是努力先靠岸吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just concentrate on getting to shore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.45,0:43:25.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 大约有200码远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay it's about 200 yards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.19,0:43:28.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们用脚轮流滑水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we kick steadily at one foot per kick,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.86,0:43:31.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们总会到岸的 嗯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'll reach it in um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.63,0:43:35.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,25分钟？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}25 minutes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.57,0:43:37.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.53,0:43:39.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的计算器也坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My calculator doesn't work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.67,0:43:43.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哇 - 哇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whoa! - Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.14,0:43:44.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱尼 你干什么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Juni what did you do?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.74,0:43:47.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,气体从充气衣跑出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The air's coming out of our suits!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.18,0:43:48.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们朝岸边去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're heading towards shore!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.33,0:44:06.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"笨重的行进"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Travel heavy"!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.63,0:44:10.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good idea!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.43,0:44:11.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.04,0:44:14.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休息一下 啊 啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it a rest. Ugh. Ugh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.77,0:44:18.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我们要找个露营点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay we're gonna set up a campsite,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.68,0:44:21.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把帐篷支起来生堆火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}put up the tent,build a little fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.75,0:44:23.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后煮点吃的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And roast marshmallows?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.85,0:44:32.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不敢相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.52,0:44:34.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.09,0:44:35.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么 就是这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing that's just it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.06,0:44:37.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是假定的营火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was supposed to make an instant campfire,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.83,0:44:39.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而那个是假定的帐篷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that was supposed to make a shelter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.46,0:44:42.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些东西都不能用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None of our gadgets work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.77,0:44:45.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说我们必须自己手动干活？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean we have to use our heads?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.74,0:44:47.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.44,0:44:49.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ouch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.45,0:44:57.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大大的办公室…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big office...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.52,0:45:03.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欧斯控制中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Director of the O.S.S.'s office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.72,0:45:06.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.48,0:45:27.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你找到着强大能量的来源没有？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you find the source of equal or greater power?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.48,0:45:29.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是从岛的北部发出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It emanates from the north side of the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.41,0:45:30.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你找到岛人的位置了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you located the lsland Man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.81,0:45:32.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就在地下的某个位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's somewhere underground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.72,0:45:35.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那好 开始挖掘 我在路上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah well start digging. I'm on my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.99,0:45:47.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on Juni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.10,0:45:48.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去查看一下这个岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go check out the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.80,0:45:50.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚架好吊床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just set up camp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.33,0:45:51.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到没有？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.94,0:45:56.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我确定加利也在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure wish Gary was here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.54,0:45:59.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一定想找出这背后的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'd want to find out who was behind all this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.01,0:46:06.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.05,0:46:09.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.89,0:46:14.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.99,0:46:17.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这地方真惊奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place is amazing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.63,0:46:19.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看那块石头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check out that rock!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.16,0:46:22.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像个大热狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like a hot dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.90,0:46:24.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh-huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.50,0:46:27.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我看够了 我们回海滩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I've seen enough. Let's go back to the beach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.87,0:46:30.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.31,0:46:31.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.35,0:46:38.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ugh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.98,0:46:40.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这儿肯定有厉害的人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody here has power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.42,0:46:43.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得找出来是什么人 他要干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to find out who and for what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.52,0:46:47.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目的地 尤卡达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destination Ukata.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.52,0:46:50.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,评估飞行时间 一分钟计算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Estimated time of arrival one minute and counting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.33,0:46:54.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在有多快？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How fast are we going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.03,0:46:57.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,85节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}85 knots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.33,0:46:59.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那好… 再快一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...go faster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.90,0:47:01.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很乐意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.07,0:47:05.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.71,0:47:11.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.55,0:47:13.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能快了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't go faster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.25,0:47:14.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.42,0:47:15.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我超越速度极限了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I broke the fast thingy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.85,0:47:18.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.60,0:47:29.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.00,0:47:31.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}now what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.14,0:47:38.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真令人恐怖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is terrific.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.37,0:47:40.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道 这真不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know,this is just great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.08,0:47:41.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次你真的做到了 杰蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really did it this time Gerti.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.05,0:47:44.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在踢我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kicking me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.25,0:47:47.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有 我离你很远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I'm way over here,cheese ball.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.51,0:48:17.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要杀了这些怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna zap that sucker to bits!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.58,0:48:19.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到这来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.69,0:48:26.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.96,0:48:29.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,留给克兹他们吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save it for the Cortezes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.63,0:48:30.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.83,0:48:35.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.40,0:48:38.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找不到他了 我刚看他从这穿过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't get it! I saw it go through this wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.30,0:48:40.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的看法呢 朱尼？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your assessment Juni?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.34,0:48:42.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我倒是认为为我的胃找点食物会比较好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd think better with food in my belly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.91,0:48:46.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我们应该到那上面去查看一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we should go up there and check it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.14,0:48:47.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那上面 火山顶？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up there to the top of the volcano?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.04,0:48:49.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.38,0:48:52.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算我的微型机械手还能用 我也不去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not even if my micrograpplers were working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.11,0:48:53.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加利肯定够胆子上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gary would be brave enough to do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.72,0:48:55.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.12,0:48:57.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你说什么也改变不了我的决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing you can say can change my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.49,0:49:03.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你刚才说什么？- 我什么也没说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What did you just say? - I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.86,0:49:09.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快跑到顶上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Race you to the top!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.72,0:49:28.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 火山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah. Volcano.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.75,0:49:32.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱尼 往后站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Juni stay back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.39,0:49:37.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是活火山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not active.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.93,0:49:40.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Juni!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.07,0:49:45.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ohh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.27,0:49:47.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还在等什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you waiting for?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.20,0:49:48.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快把我拉上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.77,0:49:51.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我的自动牵引器还能用的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If my auto retractor was working,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.27,0:49:52.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会把我们俩都拉上去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd get us both back up there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.04,0:49:55.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 好的 我要抓住你的手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh. Okay. I'm gonna grab your hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.35,0:50:02.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 喔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Ohh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.39,0:50:09.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的手机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My cellphone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.09,0:50:12.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么停下来了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why'd you stop?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.93,0:50:14.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对劲？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.16,0:50:15.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭上你的眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.53,0:50:17.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.40,0:50:21.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Juni!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.54,0:50:22.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.71,0:50:24.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.06,0:50:42.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们下降了多久了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long have we been falling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.73,0:50:44.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.33,0:50:46.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的手表停了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My watch doesn't tell time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.66,0:50:48.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你猜呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Best guess?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.46,0:50:51.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想有差不多3小时了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd say about three hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.13,0:50:53.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得有4小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feels like four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.01,0:51:08.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个时候你还能想着吃？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could you be eating at a time like this?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.12,0:51:10.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当你下落的时候你感觉怕吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that tickling sensation you get when you fall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.95,0:51:12.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.09,0:51:14.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从第一个小时以后我就没什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That pretty much went away after the first hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.92,0:51:16.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.66,0:51:18.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Waah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.86,0:51:21.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.26,0:51:23.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.60,0:51:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道 我们在漂浮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know! We're floating!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.87,0:51:30.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.84,0:51:33.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你看到什么了？- 那边 藏起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you see something? - Over there hiding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.14,0:51:34.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.44,0:51:36.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to get down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.11,0:51:39.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是卡门·克兹 欧斯的特员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Carmen Cortez,special agent of the O.S.S.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.62,0:51:40.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫罗梅罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Romero,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.95,0:51:45.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是这个岛的唯一居民…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sole inhabitant of this island of Leeke Leeke...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.66,0:51:48.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,… 唯一的人类居民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...sole human inhabitant,that is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.99,0:51:51.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.39,0:51:52.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又累又饿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tired and hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.03,0:51:55.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你们 又累又饿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice to meet you,Tired and Hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.23,0:51:59.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 啊 啊 噢 噢 - 小心 你会弄坏我的岛的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ahh! Ugh! Ohh! Ohh! - Careful! You'll crush my island!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.34,0:52:00.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.90,0:52:03.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们刚才下落了4个小时 现在都有点腿脚麻木了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just fell four hours. We're a little clumsy right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.64,0:52:06.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们没有下落 那是你们的幻觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You weren't falling. It was an illusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.48,0:52:11.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔术？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Magic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.65,0:52:17.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Science.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.02,0:52:23.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 我们必须找个安全的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quickly,we must get somewhere safe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.74,0:52:34.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是一个遗传学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a genetic specialist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.67,0:52:37.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要一个可以控制的环境来做实验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I needed a controlled environment for my experiments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.91,0:52:40.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们刚才听到的只是道具？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The creatures we've been hearing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.24,0:52:42.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的实验…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My experiments...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.54,0:52:43.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逃跑的杀人狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}run amok.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.01,0:52:45.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.69,0:52:51.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我应该多点运气才行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I would make a fortune from it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.75,0:52:54.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子们随时随地都可以拥有一个微缩动物园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kids everywhere would have their own miniature zoos,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.69,0:52:57.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在他们的卧室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}right there in their bedrooms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.56,0:53:00.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,微缩动物园？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A miniature zoo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.30,0:53:03.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人造动物… 在一个方便的水平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God's creatures... on a manageable scale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.17,0:53:12.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难以置信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unbelievable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.41,0:53:14.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我称它为 罗氏动物园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Romero's Zoo" I called it "Romero's Zoo"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.98,0:53:17.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,微缩动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}genetically miniaturized animals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.38,0:53:20.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狮子 老虎 熊 企鹅…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lions tigers bears,penguins...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.09,0:53:24.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猴子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monkeys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.09,0:53:27.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在桶里的猴子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monkeys in a barrel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.72,0:53:28.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.96,0:53:31.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.50,0:53:37.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一天 我偶然混合了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day,I accidentally mixed up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.27,0:53:39.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两组或三组实验品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}two or three different test tubes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.10,0:53:41.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总而言之创造了新的品种…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and created a new species...altogether.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.15,0:53:54.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也是"罗氏动物园二号"…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Romero's Zoo Too...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.52,0:53:58.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个完全崭新的… 微缩动物园…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an entirely new... miniature zoo...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.49,0:54:01.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每一个新物种都不同于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where each species is unlike{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.36,0:54:03.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以前见过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}any creature you've ever seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.03,0:54:05.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蝇马？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Horse-fly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.90,0:54:07.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh-huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.00,0:54:09.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃… 鱼猫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh...cat-fish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.23,0:54:12.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蛛猴？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spider-monkey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.87,0:54:15.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牛蛙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bull-frog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.31,0:54:19.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}slizzards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.51,0:54:21.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哇 - 远离他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whoa. - Stay away from those.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.78,0:54:24.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并且 我已经开始考虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so I started to think,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.18,0:54:27.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"如果我只将他们造得这么小一点点 "\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"lf only I could make them all a wee bit bigger,"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.95,0:54:30.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对于孩子们来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know for kids with meatier hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.52,0:54:35.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些都是错误的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's where things went very wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.89,0:54:37.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对他们使用了成长血清\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I applied a growth serum,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.63,0:54:39.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们便不受控制的疯狂成长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they took to it all too well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.53,0:54:43.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.24,0:54:49.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}N-N-No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.67,0:54:52.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 啊 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aah! Aah! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.37,0:54:55.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从那以后我就被困在这里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I've been locked up in here ever since.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.85,0:54:58.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再也不敢出去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid to go out there again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.68,0:55:05.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们不止一次的想吃掉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've tried to gobble me up on more than one occasion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.52,0:55:08.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么他们不把我放在眼里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do they despise me so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.69,0:55:11.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我创造了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I created them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.96,0:55:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.96,0:55:18.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝呆在天堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God stays in Heaven{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.27,0:55:20.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他 也生活在恐惧里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because he too,lives in fear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.87,0:55:22.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他也创造了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of what he's created...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.77,0:55:24.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球上的这儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}here on Earth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.87,0:55:28.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要这样看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop looking at me like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.18,0:55:29.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是笨蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm no loon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.58,0:55:30.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我仍然想知道的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I'm still trying to figure out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.95,0:55:32.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么这个岛没有公布于世？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is why this island doesn't show up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.82,0:55:34.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至在我们最先进的人造卫星上也找不到？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on even our most advanced satellites.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.88,0:55:38.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了一道"保护衣"以防止被发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I created a cloaking device to shield my island from curious eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.09,0:55:40.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何电子辐射都在半径一英里的范围内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything electronically powered that comes within a mile radius{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.02,0:55:42.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超过了就关闭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}instantly shuts down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.36,0:55:44.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的雷达都被我用"替换法"忽略了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any radar that passes over me is displaced,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.03,0:55:48.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我的岛上创造幻想是不存在的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}creating the illusion that my island doesn't exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.13,0:55:50.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔酷光碟设备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Transmooker device.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.07,0:55:51.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们怎么知道的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.87,0:55:53.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的"保护衣"设备很让人垂涎三尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your cloaking device is highly coveted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.90,0:55:56.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的人都想尝试一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People everywhere are trying to get their hands on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.14,0:56:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确认这里除了我们就没有其他人了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure we're the only humans here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.12,0:56:10.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There they are{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.55,0:56:13.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据他们的大小来判断 是两个小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}two children,judging by their size.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.16,0:56:14.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.59,0:56:17.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,微缩岛屿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a miniature of the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.40,0:56:22.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,岛中央的火山为我创造的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The center point of the volcano provides a gravitational basis{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.07,0:56:25.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,提供了重力基础\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for which my miniature creatures{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.80,0:56:28.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以有序的排列他们更大的克隆副本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can line up exactly to their larger clone counterparts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.34,0:56:31.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 无论怎样 你的微缩创造都在这个模型上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So wherever your miniature creatures are on this model,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.41,0:56:33.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而外面的却是巨大的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's where the bigger ones are outside?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.44,0:56:36.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正确 我可以通过这个办法确认它们的行动路线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Correct. I can keep track of their whereabouts this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.55,0:56:38.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到没？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.48,0:56:41.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这两个入侵的小孩正在被追击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The two intruder children are being chased by a slizzard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.15,0:56:42.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 加利和杰蒂 - 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gary and Gerti. - Leave 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.52,0:56:44.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须去帮助他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to go help them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.29,0:56:46.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不应该上岛来刺探这的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They shouldn't be snooping around my island to begin with!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.76,0:56:49.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我同意你的说法 - 我们必须去帮助他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm with you dude. - We have to help them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.09,0:56:51.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不出去那里 我会被吃掉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going out there! I'll be eaten!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.13,0:56:57.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个怪人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a bizarre man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.90,0:56:59.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 救救我们 - 救命 救救我们 救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Help us! - Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.00,0:57:01.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来人啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.37,0:57:02.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们在下面干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you guys doing down there?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.64,0:57:03.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你问得真好笑 快把我们拉上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's real funny clown. Get us out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.94,0:57:06.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们本来可以用微型机械手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We tried to activate our micrograpplers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.44,0:57:07.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但却不灵了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but they didn't deploy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.98,0:57:09.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里什么也用不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing works here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.65,0:57:12.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我们知道这些了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah we know that now. Thanks for the update,carrot top.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.45,0:57:15.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 朱尼 回来 他们需要我们的帮助 - 噢 我会帮他们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Juni come back. They need our help. - Oh I'll help them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.15,0:57:17.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会把他们拉上来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to get him back over here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.55,0:57:20.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样才能稳住我自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I can push him back over myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.29,0:57:21.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hurry up. - Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.66,0:57:23.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这儿 加利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here Gary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.33,0:57:24.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把手给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gimme your hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.36,0:57:27.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 卡门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you Carmen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.33,0:57:33.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这儿 杰蒂…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here Gerti...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.64,0:57:35.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把手给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}gimme your hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.64,0:57:37.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等会我爸爸就来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just wait till my father gets here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.47,0:57:40.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你爸爸也来了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father's coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.85,0:57:46.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要带我们去哪里 卡门？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you taking me now Carmen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.38,0:57:47.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.45,0:57:55.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你还要继续躲藏？我们都是孩子 不是妖怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you still hiding? We're kids not monsters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.39,0:57:56.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么区别？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the difference?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.36,0:57:59.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放松点 他们是欧斯特员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax. They're O.S.S. agents as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.09,0:58:01.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 一级 - 他们是唐纳根的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Level one. - They're Donnagon's kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.16,0:58:02.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唐纳根干员？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Donnagon? Agent Donnagon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.76,0:58:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们为欧斯工作？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You work for the O.S.S.,don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.27,0:58:06.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在为一个叫唐纳根的人工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I work for a man named Donnagon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.07,0:58:07.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is this guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.20,0:58:10.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 唐纳根对你的创造不感兴趣 - 为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Donnagon's not interested in your creatures. - Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.24,0:58:11.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔酷光碟设备藏在你的岛上-\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Transmooker device that hides your island{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.04,0:58:13.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那才是唐纳根真正想要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's what Donnagon really wants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.38,0:58:15.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听起来他的确不感兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not nearly as interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.54,0:58:17.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在唐纳根是欧斯的头了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that Donnagon's head of the O.S.S.,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.45,0:58:19.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有能力从你这带走设备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he has the power to take it from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.55,0:58:21.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你胡说些什么 朱尼？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you babbling about now Juni?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.25,0:58:22.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们拿走了魔酷光碟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Transmooker you took{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.68,0:58:24.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从总统的女儿手上拿走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the president's daughter Gary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.69,0:58:26.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那只是个原型\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was just a prototype.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.12,0:58:28.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真正的魔酷光碟设备藏在这个岛上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The real Transmooker device is here on this island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.29,0:58:29.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它甚至更有能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's even more powerful{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.76,0:58:31.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并且可以停止这行星上的一切科技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and can shut down all technology on the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.56,0:58:33.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说你爸爸也在来这的路上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said your father's on his way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.23,0:58:34.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想它是来寻找魔酷光碟的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think he's coming to pick it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.06,0:58:36.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都是说谎的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're all liars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.57,0:58:39.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们认为你们这么说我就会叫我爸爸回去？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you really think you're gonna turn us on our own father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.20,0:58:41.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你爸爸叫你们继续这个任务吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did your dad tell you the mission you went on{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.24,0:58:43.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有给卡门和我的计划？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was just a setup for Carmen and me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.54,0:58:44.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为什么没有？- 他有他的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why not? - He has his reasons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.04,0:58:47.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是成为一个好特工的秘诀-\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what being a good spy is all about{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.54,0:58:49.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不相信任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}trust no one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.44,0:58:51.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么成为一个特工 我们已经读过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How to Be a Spy. We've read it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.81,0:58:53.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那 再读一遍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well read it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.38,0:58:55.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个好特工和家人 朋友都没什么联系的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A good spy makes no binding connections with family or friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.05,0:58:58.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是不相信 你呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I don't believe in that do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.12,0:59:00.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你想成为一名好特工 那就最好相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want to be a good spy,you better believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.66,0:59:03.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸爸是一个伟大的特工 让我们迅速成长 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father's a great spy,so let's grow up shall we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.79,0:59:05.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管我爸爸做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever my father's done,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.46,0:59:07.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是这世界必须要做的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's what it takes to play in the big world...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.30,0:59:09.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你喜不喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Iike it or not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.50,0:59:10.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 杰蒂 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on Gerti. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.13,0:59:13.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.77,0:59:16.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 为什么你连一次都不站在我这边？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! Why can't you side with me just once?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.61,0:59:18.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么两边的问题 你是对的 他也是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are no sides you're right,and he's right too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.87,0:59:21.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是成为一个特工的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what being a spy means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.08,0:59:22.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行了 我不喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I don't like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.48,0:59:23.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那么 你放弃吧 - 我会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Then quit. - I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.98,0:59:25.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.70,0:59:45.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唐纳根是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Donnagon was right{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.47,0:59:48.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷达上没有任何它们的飞船的影子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their DragonSpy doesn't show up anywhere on radar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.50,0:59:51.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不喜欢去搜索一艘潜水艇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not interested in finding the sub.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.88,0:59:55.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得那年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember that year{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.48,0:59:58.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我亲自给孩子们做牙科手术…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I insisted on doing the children's dental work...myself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.71,1:00:00.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么会忘呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could I forget?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.62,1:00:02.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那好…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.58,1:00:05.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时我给他们装了个微型跟踪器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I installed a nonelectrical tracking device{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.42,1:00:06.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在牙齿里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in their teeth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.62,1:00:08.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我自己的发明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my own invention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.36,1:00:10.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我从未测试过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I haven't been able to test it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.03,1:00:12.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.89,1:00:14.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.23,1:00:17.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的 还有用 - 哇…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Honey it works! - Whoa...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.03,1:00:20.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难以置信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hard to believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.84,1:00:22.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按照这个来看…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But according to this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.74,1:00:26.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在海的中部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're in the middle of the ocean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.84,1:00:28.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海平面以上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Above sea level.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.14,1:00:31.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他们在地图上哪里呢 那里没有陆地啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But where they are on the map,there's no land mass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.75,1:00:34.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can that be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.42,1:00:37.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.55,1:00:41.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我么撞到什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's got us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.55,1:01:05.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 什么东西？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Aaah! - What is it?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.68,1:01:07.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你母亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.88,1:01:10.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 妈妈？- 我们想加入你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mom? - We wanted to join you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.59,1:01:12.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们疯了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you nuts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.12,1:01:13.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要一艘大船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We needed a bigger boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.96,1:01:15.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也带来了真正的食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we brought real food...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.82,1:01:19.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是干冷的压缩食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}none of that freeze-dried stuff you think's so chic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.76,1:01:21.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 基督徒 - 嗯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Son-in-law. - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.70,1:01:23.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make yourself useful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.30,1:01:24.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们怎么会在这？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.80,1:01:27.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们想帮你们把孩子们找回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We wanted to help get our grandchildren back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.54,1:01:28.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah-ah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.80,1:01:32.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要把我们的孩子找回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will get our grandchildren back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.21,1:01:33.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 噢 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gracias. Oh wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.91,1:01:36.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你嘴唇上有东西 - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You've got something on your lip. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.08,1:01:38.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 搞定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ugh! - Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.15,1:01:40.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 妈妈…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh Mom...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.12,1:01:43.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 我现在是个大姑娘了 我现在能照顾自己 行吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad I am a big girl now,and I can take care of myself okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.89,1:01:46.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格瑞利和我 我们会找到我们的孩子的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Gregorio and l,we can take care of finding our children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.42,1:01:48.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 看起来你还是没懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No you don't seem to understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.76,1:01:52.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是你和格瑞利 简单的拯救世界行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't you and Gregorio simply saving the world again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.73,1:01:56.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一次 如果你们失败了 我们失去的就太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This time we all have much more to lose if you fail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.46,1:01:58.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡门和朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carmen and Juni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.33,1:02:00.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不能跟着我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot come with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.34,1:02:02.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这太危险了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is too dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.07,1:02:06.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 你是说 我们不能控制我们自己 嗯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh you mean uh,we can't handle ourselves huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.88,1:02:18.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以要回我的胡子吗…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I have my moustache back...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.39,1:02:20.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.36,1:02:23.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果唐纳根真的上路了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Donnagon really is on his way...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.59,1:02:29.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,… 我们必须毁掉魔酷光碟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we have to destroy the Transmooker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.33,1:02:30.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问题是在哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.90,1:02:34.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,岛的另一边 不容易找到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The other side of the island. Not easy to get to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.37,1:02:36.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孤独的旅程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The journey alone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.11,1:02:38.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比魔酷光碟本身更危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is more dangerous than the Transmooker itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.74,1:02:40.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我确信这点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made sure of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.51,1:02:42.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,指给我们看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.18,1:02:44.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会出去的 是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not going out there,are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.78,1:02:47.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没有太多的选择 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have much choice,do we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.18,1:02:48.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和那些妖怪在外面跑？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With those monsters running around?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.68,1:02:50.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不相信它们是妖怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe they're monsters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.49,1:02:52.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许你这么认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you shouldn't either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.09,1:02:54.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那么 我该相信什么？- 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well what should I believe? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.32,1:02:55.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直躲在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're always in here hiding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.92,1:02:57.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许他们倒是想和你在一起作伴呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe they just wanna be with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.93,1:02:59.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和我作伴？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.19,1:03:01.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃掉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They wanna be picking me out of their teeth,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.23,1:03:02.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才是它们想要做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is what they wanna be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.50,1:03:04.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只是想告诉它们谁是老大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just gotta show them who's boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.70,1:03:05.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不害怕？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not afraid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.54,1:03:10.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要做的第一件事是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First thing you gotta do is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.14,1:03:14.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,… 从这个深渊掉下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...fall into this pit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.41,1:03:19.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么做到的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How does it work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.31,1:03:21.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来 它们是有磁性的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Supposedly,they're run magnetically.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.72,1:03:26.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要走上一条坚定的路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should be able to ride over a determined path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.33,1:03:39.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要抢在他们前面拿到魔酷光碟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to get the Transmooker before they do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.50,1:03:41.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.58,1:03:51.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变蛇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slizzards.{\r}
