Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.77,1:05:22.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 朱尼 - 电脑:消息结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Juni! - Computer: End of message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.31,1:05:32.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 格瑞利 信号表示你在绕圈 - 他不会听你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gregorio the signal requires that you go around it. - He won't listen to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.11,1:05:35.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他不会听你的 妈妈 - 选另一个方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He won't listen to you,Mother. - Choose another directi-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.12,1:05:38.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想确定他再次找不到孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants to make sure he loses the children again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.65,1:05:41.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若你愿听我们所言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you would only listen to us and do what we're saying{\r}
