Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.71,1:09:24.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.98,1:09:28.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离那间地下室不远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not far from the antechamber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.88,1:09:31.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想就在我们身后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's behind us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.06,1:09:40.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.20,1:09:42.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许它很友善\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it's friendly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.07,1:09:46.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.70,1:09:49.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.95,1:10:07.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个水下洞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an underwater cave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.72,1:10:10.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要行千里方知路在何方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll have to go all the way around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.13,1:10:11.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那需一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That'll take all day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.06,1:10:13.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这必更快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There must be a faster{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.51,1:10:30.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.58,1:10:33.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是何地？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.35,1:10:39.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想这是真金么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think that's real gold?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.45,1:10:41.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发达了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gross!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.66,1:10:44.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真泥泞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is so slimy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.26,1:10:46.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我恨泥地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate mold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.29,1:10:48.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可知你所想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can hear your thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.30,1:10:49.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.86,1:10:51.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可知我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you can hear mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.80,1:10:53.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们朱唇未启\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our mouths aren't moving,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.47,1:10:55.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们可知对方想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we can hear what we're thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.94,1:10:57.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试着说些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.84,1:11:02.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太奇怪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How strange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.71,1:11:05.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可神交\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can only communicate by thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.61,1:11:07.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 魔法 - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Magic. - Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.18,1:11:08.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.78,1:11:11.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯… 你脚超臭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um...your feet stink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.72,1:11:14.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.16,1:11:24.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 这地方真是古灵精怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay this place is really weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.97,1:11:26.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.13,1:11:27.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.51,1:11:36.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 更像那么回事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now this is more like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.08,1:11:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝藏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Treasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.78,1:11:44.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,骨头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Skeletons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.89,1:11:47.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死人骨头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dead skeletons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.36,1:11:49.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有别的么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there any other kind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.53,1:11:59.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里必是海盗囚房及藏宝处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This must've been where the pirate prisoners and treasure were kept.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.54,1:12:12.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里有个很醒目的项链\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This must've been a pretty special necklace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.78,1:12:15.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们生死相守\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for them to die fighting over it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.12,1:12:17.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为一个项链狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One necklace to rule them all{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.42,1:12:18.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放它回去 朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put it back Juni!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.69,1:12:20.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还没拿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't take it yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.15,1:12:22.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可读你思想 记得么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can read your mind,remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.39,1:12:24.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是远古邪恶之所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This land is ancient and cursed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.69,1:12:27.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你拿什么必害惨我俩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you take anything,you'll doom us both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.23,1:12:29.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.13,1:12:59.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 我想我找了条出路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! I think I found a way out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.96,1:13:01.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪条路？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.36,1:13:04.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道 你选右或左？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know you pick right or left?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.30,1:13:06.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,右\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.97,1:13:12.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.04,1:13:14.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.14,1:13:16.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们原地兜圈子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We went in a circle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.74,1:13:17.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.78,1:13:18.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.81,1:13:20.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再试试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's try it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.85,1:13:25.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 朱尼 我知我们为何至此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on Juni! I know what we did wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.02,1:13:29.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该走左\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've gotta go left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.43,1:13:33.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我或许该还此物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I should put this back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.59,1:13:34.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh-oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.63,1:13:36.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些死人骨呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are the dead skeletons?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.44,1:13:45.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aaaah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.54,1:13:47.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carmen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.38,1:13:58.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Juni!!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.65,1:14:02.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ugh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.56,1:14:05.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me!!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.56,1:14:06.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.47,1:14:16.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨 骨头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey bonehead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.21,1:14:26.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.35,1:14:34.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为何会这样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is this happening?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.02,1:14:36.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.43,1:14:43.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.50,1:14:45.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你拿了什么 是不是？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You took something,didn't you?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.77,1:14:47.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我从你之言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Y-Y-You told me not to!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.04,1:14:50.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为何我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would l?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.61,1:14:53.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.17,1:14:55.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Juni!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.68,1:14:56.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carmen!!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.09,1:15:05.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.95,1:15:07.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.56,1:15:12.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.20,1:15:23.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carmen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.77,1:15:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carmen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.61,1:15:35.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也在这 嗯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You too huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.45,1:15:37.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.22,1:15:39.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你兄在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's your brother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.62,1:15:41.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被吃了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he get eaten?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.56,1:15:45.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 他逃出找朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. He's out there looking for Juni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.63,1:15:48.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知他是故意砸烂朱尼的小虫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know he squashed Juni's bug on purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.13,1:15:50.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 我知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.26,1:15:52.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在他想去砸烂朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now he wants to squash Juni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.30,1:15:53.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不觉得我们该逃出此地？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you think we should get out of here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.81,1:15:58.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.87,1:15:59.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mm-hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.24,1:16:05.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carmen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.81,1:16:07.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在作梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm dreaming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.55,1:16:10.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沉入梦中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am totally dreaming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.39,1:16:15.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同时我也很饿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm hungry too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.93,1:16:21.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Oh. Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.44,1:16:31.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要蜜汁火腿和马铃薯片？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You like honey-roasted ham and potatoes don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.14,1:16:33.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是它们之味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what flavor this is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.54,1:16:35.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很有营养\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Highly nutritious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.71,1:16:39.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,富含蛋白质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Packed with protein and essential carbs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.11,1:16:41.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hyah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.28,1:16:45.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切半蛛人所需\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything a growing centaur needs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.99,1:16:48.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.96,1:16:55.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooooohhhh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.16,1:17:00.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 你友像被冻干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well well well. Your friend likes freeze-dried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.60,1:17:01.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So does mine.{\r}
