Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.62,1:30:14.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰蒂？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gerti?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.69,1:30:15.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.96,1:30:17.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.63,1:30:19.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让我们开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh don't even get me started.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.53,1:30:21.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到让妈妈知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just wait till Mom finds out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.10,1:30:23.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又想称霸世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you tried to take over the world again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.44,1:30:25.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 别别别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Please please please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.34,1:30:28.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别告你妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}D-Don't tell your mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.14,1:30:29.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.00,1:30:59.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.71,1:31:05.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奉总统之令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By order of the president,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.31,1:31:08.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你被暂时扣压\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you've been temporarily disavowed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.82,1:31:16.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你被炒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're fired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.52,1:31:21.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看似我失势了 但我会回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like I lost this round,but I'll be back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.39,1:31:23.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望下次你站在好的一边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hopefully you're on the good side next time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.10,1:31:24.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走着瞧 但…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll see but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.27,1:31:28.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,… 你永不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you never know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.83,1:31:30.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.54,1:31:33.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他脱线了 我会把他引回正途\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gets out of line,I'll straighten him out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.21,1:31:34.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去吧 杰蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You go Gerti.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.98,1:31:42.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你试着救我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tried to save us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.55,1:31:43.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.59,1:31:52.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你们是我亲人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you are my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.09,1:31:56.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.63,1:31:58.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球上没有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there isn't a man on this Earth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.60,1:32:01.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们认为比我对我们女儿更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'd ever think would be good enough for our daughter,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.57,1:32:02.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但 嗯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.90,1:32:05.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很接近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You come pretty close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.08,1:32:12.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以总统之命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By order of the president,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.88,1:32:15.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是欧斯新领导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you are the new director of the O.S.S.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.78,1:32:18.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.62,1:32:19.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.72,1:32:21.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are they...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.93,1:32:29.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一级\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Level one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.43,1:32:31.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.93,1:32:33.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不想要？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't want it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.80,1:32:35.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我离开欧斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm leaving the O.S.S.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.33,1:32:38.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已见到当顶尖间谍的下场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen what it takes to be a top spy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.60,1:32:42.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我会更好的帮助世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I think I can be better use to the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.11,1:32:46.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成最好的… 我自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by just being the best...me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.08,1:32:48.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那些酷装备怎么处理？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what about all the cool gadgets?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.31,1:32:51.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已得到最好装备在此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got the best gadget right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.25,1:32:56.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使用第一号 一个精致手镯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Use number one a stylish bracelet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.42,1:32:57.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,江湖再见？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See ya around?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.86,1:32:59.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.53,1:33:08.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧 说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead. Say it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.10,1:33:09.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.30,1:33:12.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已告你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.71,1:33:14.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.88,1:33:18.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.62,1:33:24.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.98,1:33:26.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做到了 老大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it boss.{\r}
